(
    id: "grown",
    name: "The Grown",
    summary: "A wary race of living ships in the outer reach, whose hulls grow back.",
    description: "They love ramming with living prows and cover the approach with thorn guns. A Grown grove does not wake when a ship comes near, only when it is provoked: shot at, rammed, scanned close by, or its wrecks stripped. Their ships come with the outer reach.",
